{"id":387,"title_slug":"fasta","title":"fasta","level":"Hard","tags":["clbg","deterministic PRNG streaming","I/O-bound"],"competitions":[{"slug":"clbg-10","name":"CLBG — 10 energy benchmarks"}],"content":"# fasta\n\nGenerate three DNA-like sequences and write them in FASTA format,\nreproducing the Computer Language Benchmarks Game fasta benchmark exactly.\nPrint all output to standard output.\n\nRandom generator. Use this exact linear congruential generator, shared and\nadvanced across the two random sections, starting from seed 42:\n    seed = (seed * 3877 + 29573) mod 139968\nEach draw first advances the seed, then uses the value seed / 139968 (a\nnumber in [0, 1)) to pick a symbol.\n\nSymbol selection. Build the cumulative probabilities of a table in the\ngiven order. For a draw value r, output the first symbol whose cumulative\nprobability is strictly greater than r.\n\n1. `>ONE Homo sapiens alu` followed by a sequence of length 2N formed by\n   repeating this ALU string (no randomness):\n       GGCCGGGCGCGGTGGCTCACGCCTGTAATCCCAGCACTTTGGGAGGCCGAGGCGGGCGGA\n       TCACCTGAGGTCAGGAGTTCGAGACCAGCCTGGCCAACATGGTGAAACCCCGTCTCTACT\n       AAAAATACAAAAATTAGCCGGGCGTGGTGGCGCGCGCCTGTAATCCCAGCTACTCGGGAG\n       GCTGAGGCAGGAGAATCGCTTGAACCCGGGAGGCGGAGGTTGCAGTGAGCCGAGATCGCG\n       CCACTGCACTCCAGCCTGGGCGACAGAGCGAGACTCCGTCTCAAAAA\n   (concatenate the five lines above into one 287-character string).\n2. `>TWO IUB ambiguity codes` followed by a random sequence of length 3N\n   drawn from this table, in this order:\n       a 0.27  c 0.12  g 0.12  t 0.27\n       B 0.02  D 0.02  H 0.02  K 0.02  M 0.02  N 0.02\n       R 0.02  S 0.02  V 0.02  W 0.02  Y 0.02\n3. `>THREE Homo sapiens frequency` followed by a random sequence of length\n   5N drawn from this table, in this order (the seed continues from the\n   end of section 2, it does not reset):\n       a 0.3029549426680\n       c 0.1979883004921\n       g 0.1975473066391\n       t 0.3015094502008\n\nWrap every generated sequence at 60 characters per line. The final line of\neach sequence may be shorter than 60. Print nothing else.\n\n## Input\nA single positive integer N read as a command-line argument.\n\n## Output\n```\n>ONE Homo sapiens alu\n<ALU-derived sequence of length 2N, wrapped at 60 cols>\n>TWO IUB ambiguity codes\n<weighted-random sequence of length 3N, wrapped at 60 cols>\n>THREE Homo sapiens frequency\n<weighted-random sequence of length 5N, wrapped at 60 cols>\n```\n\n## Invocation\nThe program is invoked as: <prog> N","hints":null,"code_snippets":{},"original_slug":null,"original_title":null,"original_function_name":null,"function_name":null,"testcases":30,"n_attempts":168,"n_accepted":126,"top_solutions":[{"submission_id":330,"model_name":"gpt-6-astra","model_version":"openai","language":"cpp","submitter":"admin","submitter_slug":"admin","status_msg":"Accepted","runtime_ms":12.79,"memory_mb":3.5625,"runtime_percentile":null,"memory_percentile":null,"avg_runtime_ms":15.217285714285714,"avg_memory_mb":3.5625,"avg_runtime_percentile":null,"avg_memory_percentile":null,"runtime_energy_j":0.001726,"avg_runtime_energy_j":0.002011857142857143,"runtime_energy_percentile":null,"avg_runtime_energy_percentile":null,"n_runs":7,"n_accepted_runs":7},{"submission_id":529,"model_name":"golden-baseline","model_version":"frozen 2026-10-10","language":"cpp","submitter":"admin","submitter_slug":"admin","status_msg":"Accepted","runtime_ms":12.79,"memory_mb":2.5,"runtime_percentile":null,"memory_percentile":null,"avg_runtime_ms":15.217285714285714,"avg_memory_mb":2.5,"avg_runtime_percentile":null,"avg_memory_percentile":null,"runtime_energy_j":3.616805714285715,"avg_runtime_energy_j":3.616805714285715,"runtime_energy_percentile":null,"avg_runtime_energy_percentile":null,"n_runs":1,"n_accepted_runs":1},{"submission_id":355,"model_name":"gpt-5.6-sol","model_version":"openai","language":"cpp","submitter":"admin","submitter_slug":"admin","status_msg":"Accepted","runtime_ms":22.314,"memory_mb":3.875,"runtim